Project Title: FlashQuizz

Description: App that creates flashcards and other tools like quizzes to help students study.

Features: 
File Upload, AI-Generated Flashcards, AI-Generated Quizzes, Multiple Quiz Types, Regenerate Questions, Study Mode, 
Score Tracking, Save Study Sets

How to run the program: 
The user uploads their study materials, such as PDF files, pictures, or plain text, then chooses what they want to create, 
such as flashcards or quizzes. The integrated AI then analyzes the uploaded sources then generates the requested study 
material based only on the provided sources. The user can then study, answer, save, or regenerate the materials.
   
Sample output:
== QUIZZ ==
1. Who is known as "The Father of Chemistry"?
   a. Lothar Meyer
   b. John Dalton
   c. Antoine Lavoisier
   d. Johann Wolfgang Döbereiner

== FLASHCARDS ==
Q: What is the Shielding Effect?
A: The shielding effect is when inner electrons block outer electrons from feeling the full attractive force of the nucleus.

